title: sortby Operator
type: text/vnd.tiddlywiki

The <<.op sortby>> operator requires at least one parameter.

```
[sortby[<order>],[<place>]]
```

* ''order'': a title list specifying the order in which to sort the input list.
* ''place'': <<.from-version "5.5.0">> (optional) controls where input titles that are missing from the <<.op order>> list are placed; specify `end` to place them after the listed titles;  Defaults to ''start''

